# Edit Pull Request Text

When updating a PR's title, body, or base:
- Never use `gh pr edit` (`gh 2.45.0` fails on the deprecated Projects-classic
  GraphQL schema and silently leaves PR text stale).
- Use the REST PATCH path or the helper script:
  ```sh
  scripts/edit-pr.sh <number> --title "<title>" --body-file <path>
  # or directly with gh api:
  gh api -X PATCH repos/<owner>/<repo>/pulls/<number> -f title="<title>" -F body=@<path>
  ```
- **Verification step (mandatory)**: check that the PR text updated by reading
  it back to detect and prevent stale-text failures:
  ```sh
  scripts/check-pr-text.sh <number> --title "<title>" --body-file <path>
  # or directly with gh api:
  gh api repos/<owner>/<repo>/pulls/<number> --jq '{title: .title, body: .body}'
  ```

